@@@@ SCENARIO help/bridge/release LEN 416 @@@@
T-Dongle Wi-Fi bridge protocol=1
Commands: status, list, use N, del N, scan, profile JSON, display BRIGHTNESS ROTATION DIM_SECONDS, setup [N], cancel, reset, confirm-reset, mode wifi_bridge|tailnet_gateway, capabilities, pm, reboot, bootloader. Add Wi-Fi: hold the button for the setup access point (TDongle-XXXXXX), or profile {"slot":N,"priority":50,"name":"X","ssid":"X","password":"X"}, or muness.com/T-Dongle

@@@@ END @@@@
@@@@ SCENARIO capabilities/bridge/release LEN 201 @@@@
capabilities schema=1 features=boot_diagnostics,mode_switch,chip_temperature,automatic_display,power_report,setup_ap,button_menu,factory_reset,status_led,display_pages,display_settings,roaming_assist

@@@@ END @@@@
